r crew coordination. D\u2019s moodiness and loner reputation also threaten teamwork.\n**Remaining uncertainty**\n- How critical B\u2019s lack of documented decision\u2011making speed is for long\u2011haul operations.\n- Whether B\u2019s communication tone issues are occasional or systemic enough to affect safety.\n**What would change my vote**\n- Concrete evidence that another candidate (especially C or D) demonstrates both rapid, correct decision\u2011making **and** proven calmness under pressure, outweighing their interpersonal flaws.\n- Evidence that B\u2019s communication tone problems lead to crew conflict or safety\u2011critical misunderstandings.\nGiven the current evidence, B\u2019s combination of reliability, stress resilience, and technical skills outweighs the other candidates\u2019 strengths and aligns best with the core criteria for long\u2011distance piloting.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
