annot confirm it meets rapid\u2011response needs.\n- The severity and frequency of B\u2019s \u201cnasty remarks\u201d and tone issues in real crew interactions.\n**What would change my vote:**\n- Concrete evidence that Candidate\u202fC is demonstrably calm under pressure and that his communication/egocentric issues are minor or mitigable.\n- Evidence that Candidate\u202fB\u2019s decision\u2011making speed is insufficient for long\u2011haul operations, or that his interpersonal behavior consistently undermines crew safety.\nGiven the current documented strengths and weaknesses, Candidate\u202fB presents the most balanced profile for long\u2011distance piloting.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
